                                          <div class="ugov-of-pd-year-rules-3"><div> - Students must obtain 3  ECTS by attending  a workshop organized by the Bachelor Programme, or further training activities (e.g., an internship).</div>
</div>
                                                                <div class="ugov-of-pd-year-rules-3"><div> - Students must obtain 12 ECTS from elective courses.</div>
</div>
                                                                <div class="ugov-of-pd-year-rules-3"><div> - Students must obtain 3 ECTS  from the Additional Language Skills Assessment.</div>
</div>
